@startuml internship_state_diagram

[*] --> Inactive: company publishes\nthe internship
Inactive --> OpenForApplications: it is the opening day for student selection\n(the current day is equal to applicationStartDate)
OpenForApplications --> Started: students are selected by the company\nto start the internship
Started --> Ended: all students have finished their internship's tasks
Ended --> [*]

Inactive: openForApplication = False
OpenForApplications: openForApplication = True
Started: openForApplication = False
Ended: openForApplication = False
@enduml